  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "This component serves as the primary service for ingesting complex FBX file formats, transforming raw binary/ASCII data into a structured ModelData object. It orchestrates parsing by utilizing FbxConverter to traverse the scene graph, extracting nodes, meshes, materials, and animation clips. It handles intricate data mapping, including vertex deduplication for meshes and converting FBX curves into linear animation channels."
  },
